{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2022-07-26 16:15:00', 'title': 'EXXONMOBIL MAKES TWO MORE DISCOVERIES OFFSHORE GUYANA', 'text': 'IRVING, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXXONMOBIL HAS MADE TWO NEW DISCOVERIES OFFSHORE GUYANA TO THE SOUTHEAST OF THE LIZA AND PAYARA DEVELOPMENTS IN THE STABROEK BLOCK. THE DISCOVERIES AT SEABOB AND KIRU-KIRU ARE THE SIXTH AND SEVENTH IN GUYANA THIS YEAR, WITH THE TOTAL NUMBER OF DISCOVERIES IN GUYANA AT MORE THAN 25. THE SEABOB-1 WELL ENCOUNTERED APPROXIMATELY 131 FEET (40 METERS) OF HIGH-QUALITY HYDROCARBON-BEARING SANDSTONE AND WAS DRILLED IN 4,660 FEET (1,421 METERS) OF WATER BY THE STENA CARRON'}